      "content": "but that's just what people say to be nice. the reality is that my life was that digital space. my community, my purpose, my entire identity... it was all tied to that platform. now that it's all gone, there’s just this hollow shell left. it feels like the 'me' that mattered is actually dead, and this version of me is just a mistake. like, why even bother trying to reconstruct something that's fundamentally broken?",
