      "content": "it just doesn't feel natural though. it feels like the universe is correcting itself. i spent years building a persona that everyone loved, and now that it's purged, it's like the world is saying i shouldn't be here anymore. if the version of me that people actually cared about is gone, then what is the point of this leftover body just taking up space? it feels like a waste of resources to keep going when the soul of my existence is already deleted.",
